{"t":"SOLV","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Solventum Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","employees":20584,"hq":"Eagan, MN, United States","website":"https://www.solventum.com","summary_en":"Solventum Corporation, a healthcare company, develops, manufactures, and commercializes a portfolio of solutions to address critical customer and patient needs in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: Medsurg, Dental Solutions, and Health Information Systems. The Medsurg segment offers solutions, such as negative pressure wound therapy, advanced wound dressings, advanced skin care, synthetic tissue matrices, I.V. site management, sterilization assurance, temperature management, surgical supplies, medical tapes and wraps, stethoscopes, medical electrodes, and medical technologies for original equipment manufacturers. The Dental Solutions segment provides dental and orthodontic products, including brackets, aligners, restorative cements, and bonding agents to span the life of the tooth, and products for preventative dental care, direct and indirect restoration, and orthodontic needs. The Health Information Systems segment offers healthcare systems with software solutions comprising computer-assisted physician documentation, direct-to-bill and coding automation, classification methodologies, speech recognition, and data visualization platforms. The company sells its products and services through direct-to-consumer, distribution, key account management, inside sales, and e-commerce. Solventum Corporation was incorporated in 2023 and is headquartered in Eagan, Minnesota.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"의료 회사인 Solventum Corporation은 미국 및 전 세계의 중요한 고객 및 환자 요구 사항을 해결하기 위한 솔루션 포트폴리오를 개발, 제조 및 상용화합니다. Medsurg, Dental Solutions 및 Health Information Systems의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. Medsurg 부문은 음압 상처 치료, 고급 상처 드레싱, 고급 피부 관리, 합성 조직 매트릭스, I.V. 현장 관리, 멸균 보증, 온도 관리, 수술 용품, 의료용 테이프 및 랩, 청진기, 의료 전극 및 OEM을 위한 의료 기술. 치과 솔루션 부문은 치아 수명 연장을 위한 브라켓, 얼라이너, 수복용 시멘트, 결합제 등을 포함한 치과 및 치과 교정 제품과 예방적 치과 치료, 직접 및 간접 수복, 교정 요구 사항을 위한 제품을 제공합니다. 건강 정보 시스템 부문은 컴퓨터 지원 의사 문서화, 청구서 작성 및 코딩 자동화, 분류 방법론, 음성 인식 및 데이터 시각화 플랫폼으로 구성된 소프트웨어 솔루션을 갖춘 의료 시스템을 제공합니다. 회사는 소비자 직접 판매, 유통, 주요 계정 관리, 내부 판매 및 전자 상거래를 통해 제품과 서비스를 판매합니다. Solventum Corporation은 2023년에 설립되었으며 미네소타주 이건에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":87.83,"mcap":14927314944.0,"pe":98.685394,"fpe":11.642164,"peg":null,"ps":1.8286556,"pb":3.1066074,"ev_ebitda":19.826,"div":0.0,"beta":0.748,"hi52":94.16,"lo52":62.38},"fin":{"rev":8162999808.0,"rev_g":-0.07,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.53828,"op":0.05905,"net":0.01911,"roe":0.03187,"fcf":180124992.0,"cash":451000000.0,"debt":5294000128.0,"de":110.177,"eps":0.89,"feps":7.54413},"own":{"short":0.035,"inst":0.76131,"insider":0.1538},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":98.38462,"median":100.0,"high":115.0,"low":75.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.2,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":7,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":7,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":7,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":7,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":95.0,"priorPriceTarget":89.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":110.0,"priorPriceTarget":105.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-14","Firm":"BTIG","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":95.0,"priorPriceTarget":95.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-06","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":101.0,"priorPriceTarget":95.0},{"GradeDate":"